// The default build is signed with Config/Juno.entitlements (HealthKit, HomeKit: both can be signed by a free Apple ID's
// Personal Team). Push is opt-in: a free Apple ID cannot sign the aps-environment entitlement, so the default build has no remote-push
// code. A paid team turns it on in Push.local.xcconfig (gitignored, next to this file; see docs/design/IOS-PROTOTYPE-HANDOFF.md):
//   JUNO_PUSH_ENTITLEMENTS = Config/Push.entitlements   (Juno.entitlements plus aps-environment: keep the two in step)
//   JUNO_PUSH_SWIFT_FLAG = -DJUNO_PUSH
JUNO_PUSH_ENTITLEMENTS = Config/Juno.entitlements
JUNO_PUSH_SWIFT_FLAG =
#include? "Push.local.xcconfig"
